// nothing here moves: the Parts are the footprints body_view.js draws on top,
// placed by its one position table in the same 894 x 894 viewBox. To change
// the drawing, edit the SVG, strip it the same way, and replace a constant
// whole; never hand-edit a path here, because it would stop being the drawing
// the operator approved.
// =============================================================================
